==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* [[Charon]] takes control of {{p|Heatran}} and defeats [[Buck]] and {{adv|Looker}}, causing them to be hospitalized.
* The [[Pokémon Association]] enlist the [[Elite Four]] to decipher Charon's notebook.
* {{adv|Diamond}} and {{adv|Pearl}} go on a journey to find the [[Legendary Pokémon]] of [[Sinnoh]] and protect them from Charon.
* Diamond and Pearl recruit {{p|Rotom}}.
* [[Paka and Uji]] are confirmed to be alive and well inside of the [[Distortion World]].
* {{p|Giratina}} enters the Sinnoh region, in [[Eterna City]].

