==Battle Frontier battles==
* {{adv|Platinum}} defeats Frontier Brains [[Dahlia]], [[Thorton]], and [[Argenta]].

==Trivia==
* This volume has connecting cover art with the {{PAV|40|following volume}}.
* The Pokémon featured in the cover of this volume are of the same [[type]] as {{adv|Platinum}}'s Pokémon. {{p|Pachirisu}} and {{p|Rotom}} are {{type|Electric}}, {{p|Cherrim}} and {{p|Shaymin}} are {{type|Grass}}, and {{p|Froslass}}, {{p|Giratina}}, and Rotom are {{type|Ghost}}.
** Also, Cherrim and Shaymin are Pokémon with two forms each.
* In {{pmin|Brazil}} and {{pmin|Latin America|Mexico}}, this volume contains the {{MangaArc|Platinum}}'s chapters from the {{PAV|38|previous volume}}.

